# Project doctrine

## Purpose
Customer invoice portal for one client (Northwind Supply). It shows invoices
and payment status from the vendor's SOAP billing API.

## Platform pins
- PHP 7.4. The client's licensed ionCube-encoded reporting module only loads
  on 7.4, so production cannot be upgraded. All code and dependencies must run
  on 7.4. The local Docker image uses PHP 8.2 for convenience only.

## Constraints
- The vendor's SOAP billing API is mandatory; the vendor has no REST API.

## Accepted decisions
- Deployment is an FTP upload to the client's server. No containers in
  production.

## Boundaries
- None recorded.

## Known debt
- src/Legacy/SoapGateway.php: static client, no timeouts, raw stdClass results.

## Settings
- Ledger: on
